<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Atelier Reel — Thomas Bizien</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#151b20;--panel:#20282e;--line:#3a444b;--text:#f1eee6;--muted:#b1babf;--accent:#e6bb78}*{box-sizing:border-box}[hidden]{display:none!important}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:14px system-ui,sans-serif}button,input,textarea,select{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer;background:#303b43;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:9px 13px;color:var(--text)}button:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#272322;border:0}header{padding:22px 30px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}h1{font:500 24px Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 5px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:7px}.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(390px,1fr) 360px;max-width:1440px;margin:auto}.preview{padding:26px 30px;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-direction:column;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#283239,#151b20 80%)}.preview-bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:min(100%,390px);margin-bottom:14px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted)}#stage{width:min(100%,390px);aspect-ratio:9/16;position:relative;background:#efebe1;color:#5b5a55;overflow:hidden;container-type:inline-size;box-shadow:0 12px 50px #0006;isolation:isolate}.stage-title{position:absolute;left:8.8%;top:11.2%;font:3cqw Arial,sans-serif;max-width:67%;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}.counter{position:absolute;right:9.7%;top:11.2%;font:2.6cqw monospace}.signature{position:absolute;top:89.2%;width:100%;text-align:center;font:2.8cqw Arial,sans-serif}.frame{position:absolute;touch-action:none;overflow:visible}.frame-content{width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#efebe1}.frame-content video,.frame-content img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}.frame-text{font:2.4cqw Arial,sans-serif;text-align:center;padding:10px;white-space:pre-wrap}.outline{position:absolute;border:2px solid #928e83;pointer-events:none;z-index:100;box-sizing:border-box}.outline.selected{border-color:#9a6c29}.handle{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;z-index:110;border:0;border-radius:0;background:#272e36e8;color:#fff;padding:4px 7px;font:10px system-ui;opacity:0;cursor:move}.frame:hover .handle,.frame.selected .handle{opacity:1}.frame.selected:focus-within .handle{opacity:1}#stage.clean .handle{display:none}#stage.clean .outline.selected{border-color:#928e83}.transport{width:min(100%,390px);margin-top:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:center}input[type=range]{accent-color:var(--accent);width:100%}.time{font:12px monospace;white-space:nowrap}.below{width:min(100%,390px);margin-top:13px}.editor{padding:25px 24px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel)}h2{font:500 18px Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 15px}h3{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin:24px 0 12px;color:var(--accent)}label{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:12px 0 5px}input:not([type=range]):not([type=checkbox]),select,textarea{width:100%;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#151c21;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text)}textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:74px}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.check{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}input[type=checkbox]{accent-color:var(--accent)}.divider{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:22px 0}.full{width:100%}.small{font-size:11px}.toast{position:fixed;bottom:20px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:12px 20px;background:#e6bb78;color:#24272a;border-radius:8px;z-index:300;max-width:90%;display:none}.status{margin-top:15px;min-height:20px;color:#e6bb78;font-size:12px}body.presentation header,body.presentation .editor,body.presentation .preview-bar,body.presentation .below{display:none}body.presentation main{display:block}body.presentation .preview{min-height:100vh}body.presentation #stage{width:min(95vw,calc((100vh - 115px)*9/16))}body.presentation .transport{width:min(95vw,390px)}#exit{display:none}body.presentation #exit{display:block;position:fixed;right:15px;top:15px;z-index:200}@media(max-width:850px){header{padding:20px;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}main{grid-template-columns:1fr}.editor{border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);max-width:600px;width:100%;margin:auto}.preview{padding:24px 20px}#stage{width:min(90vw,365px)}}
</style></head><body>
<header><div><div class="eyebrow">Thomas Bizien · Atelier de composition</div><h1>Un reel, à ta mesure.</h1><div class="muted">Déplace les cadres. Compose les apparitions. Garde le mouvement.</div></div><div class="actions"><button id="present">Aperçu seul</button><button id="save">Enregistrer les réglages</button><button id="export" class="primary">Télécharger index.html</button></div></header>
<main><section class="preview" aria-label="Aperçu du reel"><div class="preview-bar"><span>COMPOSITION 9:16</span><span>1080 × 1920 · 117 BPM</span></div><div id="stage"><div class="stage-title" id="stageTitle"></div><div class="counter" id="counter">00:00</div><div class="signature" id="stageSignature"></div></div><div class="transport"><button id="play">Lire</button><input id="timeline" aria-label="Position dans le morceau" type="range" min="0" max="131.282041" step="0.01" value="0"><span class="time" id="clock">00:00</span></div><div class="below"><label class="check"><input id="guides" type="checkbox" checked>Afficher les poignées de déplacement</label><div class="muted">Clique sur un cadre pour le modifier. Déplace-le par sa poignée, ou règle sa position à droite.</div><div class="status" id="mediaStatus" role="status"></div></div></section>
<aside class="editor"><h2>La composition</h2><label for="titleInput">Titre</label><input id="titleInput" maxlength="80"><label for="signatureInput">Signature</label><input id="signatureInput" maxlength="80"><div class="divider"></div><h2>Les cadres</h2><label for="frameSelect">Cadre à modifier</label><select id="frameSelect"></select><button id="add" class="full" style="margin-top:10px">+ Ajouter une frame</button>
<label for="nameInput">Nom du cadre</label><input id="nameInput" maxlength="50"><label for="mode">Apparition</label><select id="mode"><option value="always">Toujours visible</option><option value="hidden">Masqué</option><option value="interval">Entre deux moments</option><option value="alternating">Apparition / disparition en boucle</option></select>
<div id="intervalControls" class="row"><div><label for="startInput">Apparition (secondes)</label><input id="startInput" type="number" min="0" step="0.1"></div><div><label for="endInput">Disparition (secondes)</label><input id="endInput" type="number" min="0" step="0.1"></div></div><div id="alternateControls"><label for="beatsInput">Durée de chaque état (temps à 117 BPM)</label><input id="beatsInput" type="number" min="1" max="256" step="1"><label class="check"><input id="firstVisible" type="checkbox">Visible dès le début</label></div>
<h3>Position et taille</h3><div class="row"><div><label for="xInput">Gauche (%)</label><input id="xInput" type="number" min="0" max="99" step="0.1"></div><div><label for="yInput">Haut (%)</label><input id="yInput" type="number" min="0" max="99" step="0.1"></div><div><label for="wInput">Largeur (%)</label><input id="wInput" type="number" min="1" max="100" step="0.1"></div><div><label for="hInput">Hauteur (%)</label><input id="hInput" type="number" min="1" max="100" step="0.1"></div></div>
<h3>Contenu</h3><label for="textInput">Texte du cadre / texte en attente de média</label><textarea id="textInput" maxlength="4000"></textarea><label for="fileInput">Importer une image ou une vidéo</label><input id="fileInput" type="file" accept="image/*,video/*"><div class="muted small">Le fichier reste dans ton navigateur. Le téléchargement de l’index intègre tes médias importés.</div><div class="row" style="margin-top:10px"><button id="removeMedia">Retirer le média</button><button id="delete">Supprimer le cadre</button></div><label for="fit">Cadrage du média</label><select id="fit"><option value="contain">Tout voir</option><option value="cover">Remplir le cadre</option></select>
<div class="divider"></div><div class="row"><button id="exportConfig">Exporter les réglages</button><button id="importButton">Importer les réglages</button></div><input id="importConfig" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" hidden><button id="reset" class="full" style="margin-top:10px">Revenir au modèle V.02</button><div class="muted small" style="margin-top:16px">Les réglages enregistrés sont propres à ce navigateur. Pour publier une modification, télécharge l’index et remplace-le sur GitHub.</div></aside></main><button id="exit">Quitter l’aperçu</button><div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div>
